Ehus
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 7 DEAL STOQAQ
STOQAQ 5 FACE_LAST
STOQAQ 1 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE STOQAQ STOQAQ
OR
    AND
        SRC Suit {SPADES}
        SRC Rank 1
    AND
        DESTSRC Rank equal
        DESTSRC Suit match
MOVE_STACK STOQAQ STOQAQ
OR
    AND
        DESTSRC Rank equal
        SRCSTACK Suit match_color
    AND
        SRCSTACK Suit match
        SRCSTACK Rank ascending
DRAW
PILE ALL DRAW Size > 0
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL STOQAQ Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
